<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>International news from the Americas - France 24</title><subtitle type="html">FRANCE 24’s coverage of the political, social and economic issues in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Argentina, Brazil and across the Americas.</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/rss</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:33:38Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>California voters reject proposed one-time tax on billionaires' wealth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66aa2fe258cbd970f0aefb6faa8b3f3be68dc908cd24a6f8828fdafc3ff12731</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:32:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T03:19:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-california-voters-reject-proposed-one-time-tax-on-billionaires-wealth--23d9a4920bc9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-california-voters-reject-proposed-one-time-tax-on-billionaires-wealth" /><summary type="html">California voters have rejected a proposed 5% tax on the net worth of billionaires, handing a victory to tech leaders who poured hundreds of millions of dollars into defeating the measure. The defeat of Proposition 40 also marks a setback for progressives seeking to tax the wealth of the ultra-rich.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Amnesty urges El Salvador to disclose terms of Haiti troop deployment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2137c080679eb00dbf46c263e8d89f2ec61d88e3f4030eccd268779a663a8ff6</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:32:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T02:24:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-amnesty-urges-el-salvador-to-disclose-terms-of-haiti-troop-deployment--f3928145d38d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-amnesty-urges-el-salvador-to-disclose-terms-of-haiti-troop-deployment" /><summary type="html">Amnesty International has called on El Salvador and Haiti to make public the agreement governing the deployment of around 2,000 Salvadoran troops to the gang-plagued Caribbean nation, warning of risks to human rights and accountability.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>US Defense Secretary Hegseth faces expected impeachment vote this week</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a3fbccb7e94695a933aa272734252d9f00ad3a1cd24c29215cb4c601a3985fa2</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:32:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T22:51:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/us-defense-secretary-hegseth-faces-expected-impeachment-vote-this-week--f8706db36377.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/us-defense-secretary-hegseth-faces-expected-impeachment-vote-this-week" /><summary type="html">A Republican lawmaker moved Monday to impeach US Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth over the war in Iran, setting up a potentially explosive vote in Congress days after President Donald Trump's party suffered a crushing midterm defeat. Kentucky congressman Thomas Massie introduced eight articles of impeachment accusing Hegseth of illegally waging war without congressional authorization and abusing his powers as Pentagon chief. FRANCE 24's Fraser Jackson reports from Washington.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says he was ‘kidding’ about Dana White press secretary job, amid online mix-up claims</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e901f9d5733413f199158f3241d93620d49d2dcfc3421d93902a95da2c60b2e8</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:33:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T20:51:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/truth-or-fake/20261109-trump-says-he-was-kidding-about-dana-white-press-secretary-job-amid-online-mix-up-claims--6373b90e4085.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/truth-or-fake/20261109-trump-says-he-was-kidding-about-dana-white-press-secretary-job-amid-online-mix-up-claims" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump says he was "only kidding" when he announced he had offered his friend and UFC boss Dana White the job of White House press secretary. The president shared an AI-generated video of White behind the briefing room podium and UFC fighters attacking journalists. But the announcement also sparked online speculation that Trump may have confused the UFC executive with a former Pentagon spokesperson, also called Dana White. There's no evidence of a mix-up, as Vedika Bahl explains.</summary><category term="Truth or Fake" /></entry><entry><title>Republican congressman launches impeachment bid against Pentagon chief Hegseth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4364023660c9212f3fe6d53ca8caa7573b729e2df07beffc09745ba2ec0c841f</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:33:23Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T19:32:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-republican-congressman-launches-impeachment-bid-against-pentagon-chief-hegseth--505cf51d6d47.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-republican-congressman-launches-impeachment-bid-against-pentagon-chief-hegseth" /><summary type="html">Kentucky congressman Thomas Massie moved on Monday to force a vote in the House of Representatives to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth, putting pressure on his fellow Republicans to decide whether to remove one of the Trump administration’s most prominent figures following the party's crushing defeat in midterm elections.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shares tumble after spy probe announced</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:caa67442dc1dca84ebaec28d465f9c159b724c46faff918baad6117a56b8e706</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T16:47:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-shares-tumble-after-spy-probe-announced--b82780c21853.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-shares-tumble-after-spy-probe-announced" /><summary type="html">Shares of artificial intelligence leader Nvidia tumbled early Monday after the chip company said it launched an investigation of CEO Jensen Huang following reports he was targeted by Chinese intelligence. Nvidia shares were down more than eight percent in opening trading after its board announced that a committee of independent directors assisted by outside counsel would undertake the probe.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia CEO probed over alleged China spy: Who exactly is Jensen Huang?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d4718a0c5d375e686301bd1464b77f70300212cc24c77dacd59249f60ae5d425</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T15:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-ceo-probed-over-alleged-china-spy-who-exactly-is-jensen-huang--d5c28f6e3627.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-ceo-probed-over-alleged-china-spy-who-exactly-is-jensen-huang" /><summary type="html">AI chip behemoth Nvidia was plunged into turmoil Monday, November 9, after its high-profile CEO Jensen Huang acknowledged having an affair, with reports saying US officials believe the woman was spying for China. But who exactly is Jensen Huang, and why does this case matter so much?</summary></entry><entry><title>AI, affair and espionage: Why is Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang under scrutiny?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db67123b5c568d1bdf39fc3feb4c8261c5be7aec53ba722019c8057f495a844d</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T11:45:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-ai-affair-and-espionage-why-is-nvidia-s-chief-jensen-huang-under-scrutiny--001bc358f99a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-ai-affair-and-espionage-why-is-nvidia-s-chief-jensen-huang-under-scrutiny" /><summary type="html">Nvidia chief and tech titan Jensen Huang was in the spotlight on Monday after acknowledging an affair with a woman US officials say was working for Chinese intelligence, a claim Beijing denied.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says deportation crackdown was 'too tough' after midterm setback</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:706ba6c201590e06f5b0ad3884d63f15927643bd4dab1487e860ef54be94a95f</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:33:35Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T08:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-says-deportation-crackdown-was-too-tough-after-midterm-setback--0e7c615eb46f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-says-deportation-crackdown-was-too-tough-after-midterm-setback" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said his administration's mass deportation campaign may have been "too tough" in a television interview aired Sunday, days after Republicans suffered heavy losses in midterm elections.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Trump vows comeback as parties clash over Democrat prosecution threats</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7a0afa77c55ad29cdfaa1c6b37e9c15daccec78a06f4b31da5a190f05fca08e</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T01:13:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-comeback-democrats-prosecution-threats--3ddd0d742c90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261109-trump-comeback-democrats-prosecution-threats" /><summary type="html">President Donald Trump vowed a political comeback on Sunday after Republicans lost control of Congress in last Tuesday’s midterms, as incoming Democratic leaders pledged to hold his administration to account, and the attorney general promised to defend officials against threatened prosecutions.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shares tumble as CEO faces probe over affair with alleged Chinese spy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:85744ab3e85390bf45641dc9dd9bbb45498ccbe0cc66b9fc11f4218385c4c0d8</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:33:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T22:47:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-nvidia-shares-slide-as-board-probes-ceo-over-china-spy-reports--1815cffaf154.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-nvidia-shares-slide-as-board-probes-ceo-over-china-spy-reports" /><summary type="html">Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang is facing scrutiny after reports he was targeted in a suspected Chinese intelligence operation involving a businesswoman with whom he was having an affair. The controversy has rattled investors, sending Nvidia shares tumbling.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo criticises Milei’s austerity in Argentina, says growth must benefit all</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:47cb1ad6d40bf6b2a2119b988f616ff699863a44cf6ded6a00dd4e0020bf705c</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T22:23:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-argentina-visit-milei--0e21f75a1391.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-argentina-visit-milei" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV arrived in Argentina on Sunday from Uruguay, where his Latin America tour began, facing calls to help bridge divisions after three years of austerity under President Javier Milei. The visit to Buenos Aires is the first by a pontiff to the late Pope Francis’s homeland in nearly four decades.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo in Latin America: Papal politics and Peru</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:236402b180cd074b78eeb4dbae7e4e1eeecc1280d1c7d1fc16aa556eeecc6de8</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T21:16:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261108-pope-leo-in-latin-america-papal-politics-and-peru--dde1c7121fce.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261108-pope-leo-in-latin-america-papal-politics-and-peru" /><summary type="html">After wrapping up his first visit to Uruguay, Pope Leo XIV heads to Argentina for the second leg of his South America tour, where he's expected to draw the biggest turnout of his papacy so far. Colleen Dulle, Vatican Correspondent at America Magazine and co-host of the "Inside the Vatican" podcast, joins us to analyse the significance of Leo's Latin American tour.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo urges men to respect wives amid Latin American femicide crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7808e525b9cedc9e72af17fd4f7674df76ab7967b546ace520f72d0f96f16059</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T14:15:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-urges-husbands-to-respect-wives-amid-femicide-crisis-across-latin-america--c0353931a5d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261108-pope-leo-urges-husbands-to-respect-wives-amid-femicide-crisis-across-latin-america" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV urged men to respect their wives as he wrapped up the first leg of his 12-day tour of Latin America. The region recorded nearly 20,000 instances of women being killed over the past five years alone, most of them murdered by a current or former partner.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Paraguay: Senate impeached Peña rather than accept his offer to resign</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:43a1d3175378d70b725efdd2427c7a0e5e4d6a295e5c24c975576c86d0ce19b2</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T10:42:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261108-paraguay-senate-impeached-pe_a-rather-than-accept-his-offer-to-resign--268a291e27fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261108-paraguay-senate-impeached-pe%C3%B1a-rather-than-accept-his-offer-to-resign" /><summary type="html">Paraguay's ousted president, Santiago Peña, has been charged over the collapse of Ueno Bank. Initially placed under house arrest, he has since been transferred to a military facility for his own safety. Nearly three million customers were locked out of their accounts after regulators seized control of the online bank. Repayments are now under way, but protests continue as customers demand access to their money. Peña denies any wrongdoing. Jack Pownall reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>Donald Trump wants UFC fighters as assistants</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c1a93ba16c4170fdc8feb4e4339ca12ab84332987f1c2d2d821f236083ee8b83</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T09:44:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/donald-trump-wants-ufc-fighters-as-assistants--97d62f3fe50d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/donald-trump-wants-ufc-fighters-as-assistants" /><summary type="html">After a series of combative press briefings between the Trump administration and journalists, the US president surprised many by reportedly offering Dana White, the head of the Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC) and a longtime friend, the role of White House press secretary. Trump praised White as a “violent fighter and warrior”, but US media reports say he has already turned down the offer. Was it a punchy choice by the president or simply a punchline? Jack Pownall takes a closer look.</summary></entry><entry><title>'A violent fighter and warrior': Trump offers press secretary role to UFC chief Dana White</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:28e7255fcb0b99655f19c3c006a524bb105d3b36445452b5e6dcebf405683cea</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T20:45:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-a-violent-fighter-and-warrior-trump-offers-press-secretary-role-to-ufc-chief-dana-white--b52c016d4787.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-a-violent-fighter-and-warrior-trump-offers-press-secretary-role-to-ufc-chief-dana-white" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump on Saturday said he was asking mixed martial arts promoter Dana White to be the new White House press secretary. Trump has repeatedly tried to hitch his MAGA brand of politics to White's enormously successful Ultimate Fighting Championship.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Paraguay’s impeached president charged over business links to bank collapse</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f5d06b0d8fff09f37b37712ebd46eb08458d649d952f892bce6fd247c64c5a89</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T15:49:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-paraguay-s-impeached-president-charged-over-bank-collapse--b833d29e01a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-paraguay-s-impeached-president-charged-over-bank-collapse" /><summary type="html">Paraguay’s impeached president Santiago Peña was on Saturday charged over his business links to a major online bank whose sudden collapse locked millions of people out of their money and sparked angry protests.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo calls on Uruguay's Catholics to be 'bridge builders'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f66b3cccad2fa2769756214a873dd517d5e74a67ea144ad602e2394f994d2550</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T14:59:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-calls-on-uruguay-catholics-bridge-builders--ca30f16639ed.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-calls-on-uruguay-catholics-bridge-builders" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV urged Catholics in Uruguay to build bridges of faith and fraternity on the second day of his 12-day tour of Uruguay, Argentina and Peru. The pope's three-country tour comes just three weeks after he underwent surgery for lung cancer.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Banking scandal topples Paraguay leader</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:11dce8a99ec239125de50094908a64d7387a73f83ec82abeaae69f1005081b9b</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T12:16:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/banking-scandal-topples-paraguay-leader--780283ad5424.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/banking-scandal-topples-paraguay-leader" /><summary type="html">Paraguay’s ousted president Santiago Peña has been placed under house arrest after senators unanimously voted to remove him over a banking scandal. The collapse of Ueno Bank left nearly three million customers unable to access their savings. Peña denies any wrongdoing, while his successor, Pedro Alliana, has pledged to compensate those affected.</summary></entry><entry><title>Stephen Miller named White House Chief of Staff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:77da9ed7bfbb72fcd47ef423c2bdeb11ae67aa682915d921e18f87e25786d728</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T12:14:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/stephen-miller-named-white-house-chief-of-staff--7469c4aafa30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/stephen-miller-named-white-house-chief-of-staff" /><summary type="html">Following historic Republican losses in the midterm elections, Donald Trump has replaced his chief of staff, Susie Wiles, with her deputy Stephen Miller, the architect of his administration’s immigration crackdown. Wiles had been seen by some as a stabilising force in the White House, but with Democrats now controlling both chambers of Congress, Trump is reportedly seeking a more aggressive approach to pushing his agenda. Caroline Baum reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>Pope urges healthcare for all in Uruguay</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b67fa9cd26acdc734186bf4512bf5566e7114d551d17642a00d427ece05dcb6e</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T09:41:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/pope-urges-healthcare-for-all-in-uruguay--cc244f5a7f44.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/pope-urges-healthcare-for-all-in-uruguay" /><summary type="html">Three weeks after undergoing surgery for lung cancer, Pope Francis has begun a three-nation tour of Latin America, saying he felt better than he looked. His first stop is Uruguay, the continent’s most secular country. Jack Pownall reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>USA: Democrats vow to investigate Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:24b7faed86a1d9b521843971121e3af6d7a2818c0e1e3552f1351b435cccdd22</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T09:36:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/usa-democrats-vow-to-investigate-donald-trump--9175a9d654b5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/usa-democrats-vow-to-investigate-donald-trump" /><summary type="html">In this new era of divided government, Democratic lawmakers say their priorities will be tackling the rising cost of living, investigating alleged corruption and tightening oversight of ICE agents. Antonia Kerrigan reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>Paraguay places ousted president Peña under house arrest after bank collapse</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec71ba3b1c52fdb53928120efe9bd8dca92ff7a1692eeb4c1ab8818f9c5b1b2c</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T06:18:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-ousted-paraguay-president-under-house-arrest-after-banking-crisis--da227b173e79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-ousted-paraguay-president-under-house-arrest-after-banking-crisis" /><summary type="html">Paraguayan authorities placed ousted president Santiago Peña under house arrest on Friday, shortly after the Senate unanimously removed him from office over a massive banking crisis that locked nearly half of Paraguayans out of their savings. Peña offered his resignation over the scandal, but lawmakers pressed ahead with impeachment proceedings that stripped him of political immunity.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Giant pandas loaned by China make their public debut at US zoo</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e0c10e4a5848ec60b26ae023d8a7aca7ec6450de5108eb1281dbde6fff49325</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T02:45:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-giant-pandas-loaned-by-china-make-public-debut-at-us-zoo--998a66c6893a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261107-giant-pandas-loaned-by-china-make-public-debut-at-us-zoo" /><summary type="html">Zoo-goers watched two giant pandas loaned by China make their public debut Friday in Atlanta, where they will be hosted for the next 10 years. The pair joins the many pandas shipped to zoos around the world as part of Beijing's "panda diplomacy" program aimed at cultivating foreign ties.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo calls for healthcare to be 'accessible for all' during Uruguay visit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f04229ed76071c750913239a9eb99b9d8ae97f7720932f6eed061d86a7c35c5b</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T21:14:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261106-pope-leo-arrives-in-uruguay-for-first-stop-on-12-day-south-america-tour--c31bc7a85d30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261106-pope-leo-arrives-in-uruguay-for-first-stop-on-12-day-south-america-tour" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV on Friday called for healthcare to be "accessible to all" as he began a visit to Uruguay just three weeks after having undergone lung surgery. The 12-day tour of South America, which will also include stops in Argentina and Peru, is seen as something of a homecoming for the pontiff, who lived in Peru for almost two decades and holds joint US and Peruvian citizenship.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Trump announces immigration hardliner Stephen Miller as new chief of staff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eb588c7804b491c7e1d2c53fe047ab3d4a418e399a23eb22e55666d30306a594</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:51:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261106-trump-announces-immigration-hardliner-stephen-miller-as-new-chief-of-staff--0db36603c7f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261106-trump-announces-immigration-hardliner-stephen-miller-as-new-chief-of-staff" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump on Friday said advisor Stephen Miller would become his new chief of staff. Miller has been instrumental in driving the Trump administration's mass deportation programme and faced particular criticism after the deadly shootings of two Minneapolis protesters by ICE agents in January.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Midterms: A MAGA postmortem, Europe's 'shape-shifting' protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8c62c70ff3a0cee1e8420b8356c6293319ad2db9e80198ac1c3e53acd8b36c02</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:08:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-world-this-week/20261106-midterms-a-maga-postmortem-europe-s-shape-shifting-protests--b53f797a61ef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-world-this-week/20261106-midterms-a-maga-postmortem-europe-s-shape-shifting-protests" /><summary type="html">For a World This Week midterms special, Gavin Lee is joined by a panel of four distinguished international correspondents to assess the aftermath of the worst Republican election result since the 1970s in the wake of the Watergate scandal. We ask: is peak MAGA over? What will now change at home and abroad? And who ends the week in pole position as presidential frontrunner for 2028?</summary><category term="The World This Week" /></entry><entry><title>A homegrown Georgia moderate and pragmatist: Is Senator Ossoff the future of the Democratic Party?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4478357018facaacb49e4d3e85252a3a3e043648715901abb0a3159ab0493dfd</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T19:49:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261106-a-homegrown-georgia-moderate-and-pragmatist-is-senator-ossoff-the-future-of-the-democratic---71311042af65.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20261106-a-homegrown-georgia-moderate-and-pragmatist-is-senator-ossoff-the-future-of-the-democratic-party" /><summary type="html">Is Senator Jon Ossoff the future of the Democratic Party? Following his resounding re-election in Georgia, the 39-year-old senator has emerged as a prominent figure as the Democrats look ahead to 2028 for their next presidential nominee. His natural confidence, polished media performances and ability to appeal to a diverse electorate have prompted comparisons with Barack Obama. Yet behind the excitement surrounding his national prospects lies a more complicated question: whether political momentum in the Senate necessarily translates into a presidential frontrunner.</summary><category term="Spotlight" /></entry><entry><title>US midterms mark 'the beginning of the end' for Trump, John Bolton says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2c13a0f6a1861ba7d422562ec83488f3831c71e477f9356e59ea656617777740</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:37Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T17:26:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/t_te-_-t_te/20261106-us-midterms-mark-the-beginning-of-the-end-for-trump-john-bolton-says--bca5dae588eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/t%C3%AAte-%C3%A0-t%C3%AAte/20261106-us-midterms-mark-the-beginning-of-the-end-for-trump-john-bolton-says" /><summary type="html">In an interview with FRANCE 24, John Bolton, who served as national security adviser to Donald Trump during his first term, called the US midterm results "the beginning of the end" for Trump's stranglehold on the Republican Party. Democrats regained control of both the House of Representatives and the Senate earlier this week, marking the Republicans' worst performance since the 1974 elections in the wake of the Watergate scandal.</summary><category term="Tête à tête" /></entry></feed>
